Analysis: AE BlockMarker.createRail discards its internal return value and returns
false after generation. SRBX therefore reported create_failed even for placed rails.
AE compat lacked getLogicalRailMap and inherited the mc1122 physical-map path,
causing section-only hover and a null-array crash during teardown/uninitialized TE.
Bootstrap used an unremapped addScheduledTask name because its overload argument
was any. Explicit Callable type emits func_152343_a.
